msgstr "QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add To Branch"
msgstr "Ampio ao amin'ny Sampana"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Foano"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Tohizo"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Add the following Tree Branch."
msgstr "Tsindrio ny 'Tohizo' hanampiana ity Sampan'ny Hazo manaraka ity."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add to which Graph Tree?"
msgstr "Ampiana ao amin'ny Hazon-kisary iza?"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has Created Tree and/or Branch and added Graphs"
msgstr "Namorona Hazo sy/na Sampana ary nampiditra Kisary ny QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "QuickTree has no Graphs Queued"
msgstr "Tsy misy kisary miandry ao amin'ny QuickTree"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Information/Directions"
msgstr "Fampahalalana/Torolalana"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "The Graphs below are Queue to be added to a Cacti Tree.  You may keep them here for as long as you like, or you can perform one of the following actions"
msgstr "Ireo kisary eto ambany dia ao anatin'ny laharam-piandrasana hampidirina ao amin'ny Hazo Cacti.  Azonao tazonina eto araka izay tianao izy ireo, na azonao atao ny iray amin'ireto hetsika manaraka ireto"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection to a new Graph Tree so you can keep them for later and work on something new."
msgstr "Tehirizo ao amin'ny Hazon-kisary vaovao ny safidinao mba hitahirizanao azy ireo ho amin'ny manaraka ary hiasanao zavatra vaovao."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Save your selection as a branch to an existing tree so that they appear in a specific section of an existing tree."
msgstr "Tehirizo ho sampana ao amin'ny hazo efa misy ny safidinao mba hisehoany amin'ny fizarana manokana ao amin'ny hazo efa misy."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear all graphs"
msgstr "Fafao daholo ny kisary"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Clear the Graphs on this page from the Graphs Queue so that you have a blank QuickTree ready for new selections"
msgstr "Esory ao amin'ny laharam-piandrasan'ny kisary ny kisary eto amin'ity pejy ity mba hanananao QuickTree madio vonona amin'ny safidy vaovao"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "You can manage the individual graphs that appear here by clicking:"
msgstr "Azonao tantanina tsirairay ireo kisary miseho eto amin'ny fipihana ny:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Manampy"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Graph View Page"
msgstr "Pejy Fijerena Kisary"

#: quicktree.php
#, php-format
msgid "This icon is next to a Graph on the %s tab."
msgstr "Ity sary famantarana ity dia eo akaikin'ny Kisary ao amin'ny tabilao %s."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Fafao"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "This icon next to the Graphs below to remove them from the QuickTree Queue."
msgstr "Ity sary famantarana eo akaikin'ireo Kisary eto ambany ity dia hanesorana azy ireo ao amin'ny laharam-piandrasan'ny QuickTree."

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Fanamarihana:"

#: quicktree.php
msgid "Adding, removing or clearing on this page does not affect any other parts of Cacti (only Creating/Saving does)"
msgstr "Ny fanampiana, fanesorana na famafana eto amin'ity pejy ity dia tsy misy fiantraikany amin'ny faritra hafa amin'ny Cacti (ny Famolavolana/Fitahirizana ihany no manova)"

